OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies of the Disappeared to
OL,4,Ameet the Pope
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome families of the Disappeared will
OL,7,Fmeet Pope Leo XIV on Wednesday in what
OL,8,Fis hoped will be a "spiritual boost"
OL,9,Ffor the relatives.
OL,11,FThe Disappeared are those who were
OL,12,Fabducted, murdered and secretly buried
OL,13,Fby republicans during Northern
OL,14,FIreland's Troubles.
OL,16,FDespite extensive and painstaking
OL,17,Fsearches, the bodies have never been
OL,18,Ffound of four out of 17 people listed
OL,19,Fby the commission set up to locate
OL,20,Fvictims' remains.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
