OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies of the Disappeared to
OL,4,Ameet the Pope
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe trip has been organised by the WAVE
OL,7,FTrauma Centre, which has supported the
OL,8,Ffamilies since 1995.
